---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Services — Griffith Creative | Web Design Packages"
  description="Custom web design packages for small and mid-sized businesses. Three tiers built for speed, performance, and conversion. Book a free call to get started."
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 fade-in">
          Services
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight mb-6 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          Everything you need.<br />
          Nothing you don't.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          Three clear tiers. Every site is built for speed, performance, and conversion, no matter which package you choose. Book a call and we'll recommend the right fit.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Tiers -->
  <section class="bg-dark-secondary py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

        <!-- Tier 1 -->
        <div class="bg-dark p-8 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5 flex flex-col fade-in">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Starter</p>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-1">5-Page Website</h2>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm mt-4">Delivered in 1–2 weeks</p>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 flex-1">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>5 custom-designed pages</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Mobile-responsive design</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Search-ready foundations built in</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>AI-readable schema & llms.txt setup</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Contact form integration</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Google Analytics setup</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Fast hosting on Vercel or Netlify</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>2 rounds of revisions</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-xs mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Best for new businesses that need a clean, professional web presence quickly.
          </p>

          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="border border-accent text-accent font-semibold py-3 rounded text-center hover:bg-accent hover:text-dark transition-colors"
          >
            Get a Quote
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 2 -->
        <div class="bg-dark p-8 rounded-lg border-2 border-accent flex flex-col relative fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <div class="absolute -top-3 left-8 bg-accent text-dark text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded">
            Most Popular
          </div>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Growth</p>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-1">10-Page Website</h2>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm mt-4">Delivered in 2–3 weeks</p>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 flex-1">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>10 custom-designed pages</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Everything in Starter</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Search-ready structure & metadata</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>AI search optimization (ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Blog setup with 3 initial posts</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Google Business Profile optimization</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Schema markup built in</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Conversion tracking setup</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>3 rounds of revisions</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-xs mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Best for established businesses that need a site built to generate leads and grow with them.
          </p>

          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="bg-accent text-black font-bold py-3 rounded text-center hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors"
          >
            Get a Quote
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 3 -->
        <div class="bg-dark p-8 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5 flex flex-col fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Authority</p>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-1">20-Page Authority Site</h2>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm mt-4">Delivered in 3–4 weeks</p>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 flex-1">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>20+ custom-designed pages</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Everything in Growth</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Comprehensive content strategy</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>AI citation tracking & visibility reports</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Service area pages</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Competitor analysis & gap targeting</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Custom integrations (booking, CRM)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Priority support & unlimited revisions</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-xs mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Best for multi-location businesses that need a comprehensive web presence to dominate their market.
          </p>

          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="border border-accent text-accent font-semibold py-3 rounded text-center hover:bg-accent hover:text-dark transition-colors"
          >
            Get a Quote
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Care Plan -->
  <section class="bg-dark-secondary py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="fade-in">
          <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
            Optional Add-On
          </p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">
            Care Plan
          </h2>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg leading-relaxed mt-6">
            Your site launches complete. If you'd rather never think about it again, the Care Plan keeps it fast, current, and secure — updates handled by the person who built it. Monthly, scoped to your site, cancel anytime. Book a call to learn more.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-6 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Updates & Changes</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm">Content edits, new sections, seasonal updates — handled within days, not weeks.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-6 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Hosting & Monitoring</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm">Managed hosting, uptime monitoring, and performance checks so the site stays fast.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-6 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Security & Backups</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm">Dependency updates, SSL, and automatic backups. If something breaks, we fix it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-6 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Priority Support</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm">One point of contact — the same person who built your site answers the email.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's Included in Every Project -->
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-16 fade-in">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
          Included in every project.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg">
          No hidden fees. No add-on upsells. This is standard.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center p-6 fade-in">
          <div class="text-accent text-2xl font-bold mb-3">100</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-sm mb-2">PageSpeed Score</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-xs">We target perfect Lighthouse scores on every build.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <div class="text-accent text-2xl font-bold mb-3">SSL</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-sm mb-2">Security</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-xs">HTTPS everywhere. Secure headers. Production-ready from day one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          <div class="text-accent text-2xl font-bold mb-3">ADA</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-sm mb-2">Accessibility</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-xs">WCAG-informed design and semantic markup for inclusive access.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 fade-in fade-in-delay-3">
          <div class="text-accent text-2xl font-bold mb-3">CDN</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-sm mb-2">Global Speed</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-xs">Edge-deployed on a global CDN for sub-second load times.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-dark-secondary py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center fade-in">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
        Not sure which tier is right?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        Book a free discovery call. We'll look at your current site, discuss your goals, and recommend the right package. No pressure, no pitch deck.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block bg-accent text-black font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors text-lg"
      >
        Book a Free Call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
